WEBVTT

01:29.240 --> 01:34.310
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.750 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 15]

02:35.790 --> 02:40.740
[Open]

02:43.280 --> 02:44.190
I only had one thought

02:44.190 --> 02:45.450
in my mind at that time.

02:46.000 --> 02:47.240
It'd be great if I could

02:47.240 --> 02:48.100
have a bicycle.

02:48.240 --> 02:49.910
Then I could get home faster.

02:50.440 --> 02:51.360
Which one do you like?

02:51.360 --> 02:52.150
The bicycle.

02:53.760 --> 02:54.790
[Congratulations to the player
on the 16,888 accumulated tickets!]

02:54.810 --> 02:55.720
[By breaking the historical record
in this arcade,]

02:55.740 --> 02:56.760
[you could get the grand prize,
a branded bicycle.]

03:00.260 --> 03:01.580
[Heartbeat Player]

04:04.810 --> 04:05.940
I'm going to work.

04:06.270 --> 04:07.820
Remember to eat when you wake up.

04:07.820 --> 04:08.450
Wan.

04:33.890 --> 04:35.140
Qi, what happened?

04:35.440 --> 04:36.430
There weren't many people

04:36.430 --> 04:37.360
after midnight.

04:37.420 --> 04:38.190
But Xixiao

04:38.190 --> 04:39.190
played here all night

04:39.190 --> 04:40.310
until past 4 AM.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.950
He even redeemed our shop's grand prize,

04:41.950 --> 04:43.390
namely that bicycle.

04:43.220 --> 04:45.060
[Congratulations to the player
on the 16,888 accumulated tickets!]

04:44.290 --> 04:45.480
I already fell asleep on the desk.

04:45.080 --> 04:46.050
[By breaking the historical record
in this arcade,]

04:45.480 --> 04:46.240
When he left,

04:46.070 --> 04:50.540
[you could get the grand prize,
a branded bicycle.]

04:46.270 --> 04:48.400
he woke me up again to redeem the prize.

04:51.270 --> 04:53.330
The machines were all out of tickets.

04:59.450 --> 05:01.630
[Heartbeat Player]

05:00.350 --> 05:04.070
♪ Are you out there waiting for me ♪

05:05.590 --> 05:08.240
♪ Through the dark, bravely, steadily ♪

05:09.260 --> 05:12.850
♪ If I could run and land with you ♪

05:15.230 --> 05:18.160
♪ After the long night ♪

05:19.850 --> 05:21.850
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

05:22.910 --> 05:26.030
♪ Thinking about ♪

05:27.260 --> 05:30.500
[Zhou Wan, Move forward to your new life
and be happy. Xixiao]

05:27.690 --> 05:31.100
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

05:33.280 --> 05:35.500
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

05:35.560 --> 05:36.930
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

05:37.060 --> 05:39.930
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

05:41.320 --> 05:43.360
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

05:43.480 --> 05:47.400
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

05:48.710 --> 05:50.450
♪ In this boring universe ♪

05:50.540 --> 05:52.090
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

05:52.230 --> 05:56.420
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

05:56.640 --> 05:57.850
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

05:59.060 --> 06:02.210
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

06:03.890 --> 06:06.460
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

06:23.520 --> 06:24.310
Hello?

06:26.370 --> 06:28.030
Did I wake you up?

06:29.920 --> 06:30.800
I heard you played

06:30.800 --> 06:32.120
the games all night.

06:34.740 --> 06:35.540
What's wrong?

06:40.770 --> 06:42.100
Thank you for your gift.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.390
I really like it.

06:49.960 --> 06:50.770
So you saw it?

06:52.260 --> 06:53.600
I thought you'd have to wait until tonight

06:53.600 --> 06:54.510
to see it.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.270
It was too late yesterday,

06:57.270 --> 06:58.070
and the places selling bikes

06:58.070 --> 06:59.000
were all closed.

06:59.240 --> 07:01.970
I had no choice
but to win that one from the arcade.

07:04.380 --> 07:05.870
[I'm going to work.
Remember to eat when you wake up. Wan]

07:09.830 --> 07:11.160
Why did you leave me a note

07:11.160 --> 07:12.630
after I left you one?

07:17.090 --> 07:17.990
This time,

07:17.900 --> 07:23.360
♪ The narcissus rides a carp,
drifting away in sadness ♪

07:18.800 --> 07:20.000
you don't think it's the magic

07:20.000 --> 07:21.730
that can make wishes come true?

07:25.010 --> 07:30.430
♪ Deep green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebula ♪

07:26.320 --> 07:27.490
I'm not stupid.

07:27.600 --> 07:28.930
How old do you think I am?

07:30.750 --> 07:31.430
During the daytime,

07:31.430 --> 07:32.920
why didn't you just give it to me?

07:32.240 --> 07:37.960
♪ On countless nights, we move forward ♪

07:33.950 --> 07:35.720
Carrying it up
to the 3rd floor by yourself,

07:35.720 --> 07:36.980
didn't you feel tired?

07:37.820 --> 07:38.590
No, I didn't.

07:39.350 --> 07:41.530
♪ Seeking, waking up and collecting ♪

07:40.750 --> 07:42.350
It's a gift for your new life.

07:43.020 --> 07:44.890
♪ Crazy love ♪

07:43.190 --> 07:44.000
Of course I had to put it

07:44.000 --> 07:45.730
at the door of your house today.

07:46.110 --> 07:50.990
♪ Say yes, let's start fresh ♪

07:49.740 --> 07:51.500
From now on, every step

07:52.460 --> 07:53.710
will be taken smoothly.

07:53.580 --> 07:55.950
♪ Someone lights the fire ♪

07:56.830 --> 08:00.170
♪ The love burns each other ♪

07:59.300 --> 07:59.890
Zhou Wan.

08:00.280 --> 08:03.200
♪ My organs ♪

08:01.040 --> 08:02.160
There is no magic in this world

08:02.160 --> 08:03.870
that can make wishes come true.

08:03.360 --> 08:06.720
♪ Every midnight ♪

08:06.890 --> 08:09.300
♪ I'll play the instrument for you ♪

08:07.520 --> 08:08.280
But I am here.

08:23.040 --> 08:23.850
Hello?

08:31.600 --> 08:32.240
So,

08:34.900 --> 08:36.080
when I want to ride it,

08:36.080 --> 08:37.630
you have to help me
carry it down to the 1st floor.

08:36.970 --> 08:38.350
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

08:39.760 --> 08:42.630
♪ Let's dance ♪

08:44.270 --> 08:45.690
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

08:44.310 --> 08:44.870
Okay.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.250
I'll carry you down to the 1st floor, too.

08:46.910 --> 08:49.860
♪ Follow your steps ♪

08:49.710 --> 08:50.570
Pinky promise.

08:51.330 --> 08:53.600
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

08:53.700 --> 08:56.820
♪ Close my eyes and count ♪

08:53.840 --> 08:54.960
Pinky promise.

08:58.460 --> 09:00.370
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

09:00.540 --> 09:04.300
♪ Open your eyes and see me ♪

09:01.530 --> 09:04.130
Then I won't disturb you
while you're napping.

09:05.690 --> 09:07.500
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

09:08.490 --> 09:11.200
♪ Let's dance ♪

09:13.090 --> 09:14.680
