10:31.660 --> 10:34.670
Fang! Fang! Fang!

10:35.360 --> 10:37.200
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

10:41.370 --> 10:43.120
Mr. Fang, I won't do it again.

10:43.430 --> 10:45.000
