10:55.840 --> 10:56.600
Fang.

10:59.030 --> 10:59.720
Fang.

10:59.740 --> 11:01.080
You really won't do it again?

11:01.080 --> 11:02.000
I really won't.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.270
I really won't.

11:10.240 --> 11:10.840
Fang.

11:13.670 --> 11:14.410
Fang.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.240
I just did it

11:15.240 --> 11:16.390
