11:29.450 --> 11:30.520
Fang, I won't do it again!

11:30.520 --> 11:33.330
Fang! Fang! Fang! Fang, I won't do it!

12:10.700 --> 12:11.850
You're still awake?

12:13.000 --> 12:14.150
I just took a shower.

12:15.060 --> 12:16.320
Now I'm going to sleep.

12:19.490 --> 12:20.480
I can't sleep.

12:21.230 --> 12:22.490
I want to hear you talk.

12:26.330 --> 12:28.590
You're just afraid I can't sleep, right?

12:36.910 --> 12:37.880
Lu Xixiao.

12:39.240 --> 12:40.300
What are you doing?

12:43.850 --> 12:44.850
I'm drawing.

12:47.470 --> 12:48.670
What are you drawing?

12:51.410 --> 12:52.670
I haven't decided yet.

12:54.630 --> 12:56.390
This summer seems so long.

12:59.180 --> 13:00.820
I want winter to come sooner.

13:02.970 --> 13:04.230
When winter comes,

13:05.150 --> 13:06.550
what would you like to do?

13:11.600 --> 13:12.810
I want to see snow.

13:18.370 --> 13:19.510
You like snow, huh?

13:21.680 --> 13:23.300
I think it's very clean.

13:26.370 --> 13:27.410
Lu Xixiao.

13:28.430 --> 13:30.560
You must have seen snow before, right?

13:36.000 --> 13:37.530
I've never seen it, either.

13:39.930 --> 13:40.770
Really?

13:41.520 --> 13:45.110
[6] [Hang up]

13:43.390 --> 13:44.070
Really.

13:49.640 --> 13:51.100
Then at the end of the year,

13:52.120 --> 13:53.850
let's go see the snow together.

13:57.140 --> 13:59.670
It's a pity
that it doesn't snow in Pingchuan.

14:03.930 --> 14:05.840
Now that I'm saying I can let you see it,

14:05.840 --> 14:07.170
then you can just see it.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.170
Zhou Wan.

14:22.410 --> 14:23.100
Zhou Wan?

14:30.540 --> 14:32.070
You fell asleep so quickly.

14:35.350 --> 14:41.100
