[Hang up] [The speaker is on.]

16:26.550 --> 16:27.460
Sir.

16:27.550 --> 16:28.790
I'd like a bowl of pork rib noodles.

16:28.790 --> 16:29.580
Okay.

16:29.810 --> 16:31.270
Sit here and wait a moment.

16:35.350 --> 16:36.120
Coming.

16:38.060 --> 16:39.090
I'm on the phone.

16:39.410 --> 16:42.680
[Uncle Kang's Noodle Shop,
Handmade Noodles]

16:39.740 --> 16:40.870
I'm on the phone now.

16:43.540 --> 16:45.100
Give me a special meal.

16:45.490 --> 16:47.290
Okay. Sit here and wait a moment.

16:49.920 --> 16:53.470
[Please get your utensils here.]

17:20.829 --> 17:21.640
Lu Xixiao.

17:22.880 --> 17:23.720
Lu Xixiao.

17:26.420 --> 17:26.940
Hello?

17:27.730 --> 17:28.530
You're awake.

17:29.640 --> 17:30.270
I'm here in Uncle Kang's shop

17:30.270 --> 17:30.920
to buy you some noodles.

17:30.920 --> 17:32.520
I'll bring them to you later.

17:35.890 --> 17:37.220
Are you here in my place?

17:37.880 --> 17:42.540
[Please get your utensils here.]

17:39.510 --> 17:40.000
Who's there?

17:40.000 --> 17:41.400
I'm in Uncle Kang's shop.

17:41.730 --> 17:42.330
Hello?

17:48.460 --> 17:49.450
Who's there?

17:51.140 --> 17:51.820
What?

17:53.550 --> 17:54.160
-Hello? Hello?
-Hey!

17:54.160 --> 17:55.960
You haven't taken your noodles!

18:00.480 --> 18:01.280
You're awake.

18:02.450 --> 18:04.330
You're a snitch.

18:04.350 --> 18:05.880
Bro, the noodles are ready.

18:06.460 --> 18:07.260
Put them here.

18:09.520 --> 18:10.890
Sit! Sit down!

18:13.200 --> 18:14.040
You want to make a call?

18:14.040 --> 18:15.440
Give the mobile phone back to me!

18:15.440 --> 18:16.040
Go inside!

18:30.850 --> 18:31.690
Luo He.

18:32.260 --> 18:33.920
What exactly do you want to do?

18:34.380 --> 18:35.850
Your grandma and I

18:36.260 --> 18:38.390
are old acquaintances to some extent.

18:39.340 --> 18:40.030
Fen.

18:41.600 --> 18:43.600
Your granddaughter made a mistake.

18:44.670 --> 18:45.750
What should I do?

18:46.760 --> 18:48.130
I was telling the truth.

18:54.440 --> 18:55.610
So it was really you?

18:57.030 --> 18:57.640
Zhou Wan.

19:05.030 --> 19:05.670
What?

19:09.460 --> 19:12.520
You're telling me
to take away all the valuable things

19:13.340 --> 19:15.200
and smash all the valueless ones?

19:19.280 --> 19:21.480
Fen really knows how to get things done.

19:22.680 --> 19:24.410
Don't you dare touch anything!

19:25.360 --> 19:26.560
I'll call the police.

19:26.810 --> 19:27.470
Smash them!

19:33.470 --> 19:34.620
Do you know how to smash?

19:34.620 --> 19:36.130
Smash the expensive ones!

19:36.160 --> 19:36.640
Bro,

19:37.000 --> 19:38.200
i-is this expensive?

19:39.550 --> 19:40.550
Don't smash this!

19:43.680 --> 19:44.480
-Come here.
-Let go of me!

19:44.480 --> 19:46.280
This one is valueless.

19:46.720 --> 19:48.270
This one is valueless, too.

19:48.270 --> 19:49.480
What else is valuable?

19:49.480 --> 19:50.740
Tell me what's valuable!

19:50.740 --> 19:51.300
Bro.

19:52.660 --> 19:53.660
Is this valuable?

19:54.640 --> 19:55.900
This one is quite valuable.

19:55.900 --> 19:57.340
This one is valuable!

19:57.370 --> 19:58.000
Zhou Wan,

19:58.560 --> 19:59.640
since Fen has passed away,

19:59.640 --> 20:00.900
and I was so close to her,

20:00.900 --> 20:02.550
I'll teach you a lesson for her today.

20:02.550 --> 20:03.440
Is that okay?

20:06.240 --> 20:07.570
How dare you hit my boss?

20:10.090 --> 20:10.690
Come here.

20:12.080 --> 20:14.140
I'd like to see who dares to touch her!

20:16.640 --> 20:17.770
You're just in time.

20:18.310 --> 20:19.250
Lu Xixiao,

20:20.070 --> 20:22.550
-Let's settle both our old and new scores!
-Hello, is that 110?

20:22.550 --> 20:23.850
What? Besides the hobby of fighting,

20:23.850 --> 20:27.250
-do you have nothing else to do?
-Stop talking nonsense here!

20:29.610 --> 20:30.520
Come here!

20:31.890 --> 20:32.620
I'll also...

20:33.310 --> 20:35.390
Put it down now! Put it down!

20:36.130 --> 20:36.590
Hit him.

20:40.130 --> 20:41.660
The police are downstairs!

20:42.120 --> 20:43.450
Come on! Hit me!

20:43.790 --> 20:44.270
You!

20:44.540 --> 20:45.030
Hit me.

20:45.630 --> 20:46.950
Come here! Hit me!

20:47.530 --> 20:48.330
Lu Xixiao.

20:50.520 --> 20:52.040
You! Hit me! Come on!

20:52.070 --> 20:53.530
Hit me right here! Come on!

20:53.750 --> 20:54.270
Officer!

20:54.270 --> 20:55.830
-I truly did nothing illegal this time.
-Take them away!

20:55.830 --> 20:56.420
Don't move!

20:56.420 --> 20:57.280
Take them away!

20:59.780 --> 21:01.180
Where is your Officer Li?

21:01.870 --> 21:02.790
Officer Li! Officer Li!

21:02.790 --> 21:03.790
I truly did nothing illegal this time.

21:03.790 --> 21:05.090
I'm a good citizen.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.000
Luo?

21:06.640 --> 21:07.590
We've met again.

21:08.020 --> 21:09.480
You're a repeat offender.

21:09.510 --> 21:10.440
Go! Take him away!

21:10.440 --> 21:11.470
This guy is trying to scam me!

21:11.470 --> 21:12.200
Officer Li!

21:13.760 --> 21:14.360
Bro.

21:14.710 --> 21:15.540
-Where are you going?
-Zhou Wan.

21:15.540 --> 21:16.410
Here is another one.

21:16.410 --> 21:17.260
Zhou Wan!

21:17.590 --> 21:18.350
Are you okay?

21:18.910 --> 21:20.440
-I'm fine.
-What happened?

21:21.000 --> 21:22.050
You and the young man at the door

21:22.050 --> 21:22.900
have to go back
to the police station with me

21:22.900 --> 21:24.030
to make a statement.

21:24.050 --> 21:24.490
Okay.

21:25.840 --> 21:27.700
Go ahead. I'll clean up the place.

21:29.000 --> 21:29.720
Thank you.

21:29.740 --> 21:30.270
Which Xi?

21:30.270 --> 21:31.160
Xi.

21:31.320 --> 21:33.270
X-i, Xi.

21:33.830 --> 21:34.440
And Xiao?

21:34.890 --> 21:35.560
Xiao.

21:36.280 --> 21:37.200
X-i-a-o, Xiao.

21:37.850 --> 21:39.870
What's your relationship
with the homeowner?

21:39.870 --> 21:40.730
We're friends.

21:59.030 --> 21:59.760
Are you okay?

22:02.030 --> 22:02.960
Are you injured?

22:03.480 --> 22:03.850
Come on.

22:03.850 --> 22:05.780
Go back with us to make a statement.

22:17.080 --> 22:24.440
[Chengnan Police Station]

22:17.550 --> 22:18.900
He trespassed on a private house

22:18.900 --> 22:20.300
and tried to pick a fight.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.510
From compensation to sentencing,

22:21.510 --> 22:23.400
it'll definitely be enough
to make him suffer.

22:23.400 --> 22:23.920
From now on, Luo He

22:23.920 --> 22:25.920
won't be able to harass you anymore.

22:26.170 --> 22:28.100
Then don't try to be a hero anymore.

22:28.680 --> 22:29.680
I don't want to see you

22:29.680 --> 22:31.280
get hurt because of me again.

22:32.070 --> 22:33.070
Alright.

22:34.250 --> 22:37.720
[Public Security]

22:34.400 --> 22:34.980
Look. I'm completely

22:34.980 --> 22:36.040
fine now, aren't I?

22:36.200 --> 22:36.790
Right?

22:37.240 --> 22:37.790
Don't worry.

22:37.790 --> 22:38.790
What's this?

22:39.790 --> 22:40.590
Don't worry.

22:44.660 --> 22:50.550
[Police]

22:45.480 --> 22:46.000
Don't worry.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.730
Don't get into fights anymore.

22:49.370 --> 22:49.920
Okay.

22:54.310 --> 22:55.540
Couldn't you drive safely?

22:55.540 --> 22:57.670
Didn't you see you almost hit someone?

22:58.670 --> 22:59.810
Couldn't you drive safely?

22:59.810 --> 23:02.070
Our boss, Mr. Fang, would like to see you.

23:05.670 --> 23:06.660
Who is Mr. Fang?

23:09.950 --> 23:11.190
I need to go see him.

23:17.490 --> 23:18.840
Luo He has always

23:21.260 --> 23:22.740
been an arrogant guy.

23:25.240 --> 23:26.680
This is a great opportunity

23:26.680 --> 23:27.720
to teach him a lesson.

23:27.720 --> 23:28.850
Here. Have some tea.

23:31.890 --> 23:33.670
As for the money you gave him,

23:34.250 --> 23:36.400
I can use part of it

23:36.430 --> 23:37.960
as interest to pay the debt.

23:38.920 --> 23:39.750
It can be considered

23:39.750 --> 23:41.680
as an explanation to your grandma.

23:52.080 --> 23:53.240
Actually, I want to talk to you

23:53.240 --> 23:54.400
about the house.

24:00.380 --> 24:01.790
There's 150,000 yuan in this card.

24:01.060 --> 24:04.440
[Harmony Brings Wealth]

24:04.380 --> 24:06.500
After deducting
my grandma's hospitalization costs

24:06.500 --> 24:07.760
and funeral expenses,

24:08.090 --> 24:09.620
there's 120,000 yuan left.

24:11.560 --> 24:12.720
I want to use it to redeem

24:12.720 --> 24:13.920
the mortgaged house.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.660
I wonder whether it's enough.

24:19.170 --> 24:20.630
You two can have some tea first.

24:20.630 --> 24:22.030
I'll check the accounts.

24:22.800 --> 24:23.670
Thank you.

24:38.160 --> 24:39.400
Your grandma's house

24:39.400 --> 24:41.730
was mortgaged for 500,000 yuan back then.

24:42.750 --> 24:44.070
Excluding the money
that has been returned

24:44.070 --> 24:45.550
over the years

24:45.550 --> 24:47.890
and the kickbacks Luo He has taken,

24:48.870 --> 24:49.990
you still owe me 170,000 yuan.

24:49.310 --> 24:53.030
[Harmony Brings Wealth]

24:51.170 --> 24:53.430
That little money of yours isn't enough.

24:57.840 --> 24:59.640
I'll try to think of another way.

25:00.720 --> 25:01.750
Can the house be first...

25:01.750 --> 25:02.590
Miss,

25:03.470 --> 25:05.320
business is business.

25:06.640 --> 25:09.080
Many houses have been mortgaged to me

25:09.340 --> 25:10.110
over the years.

25:10.110 --> 25:10.880
If everyone

25:10.880 --> 25:11.750
had acted like you guys,

25:11.750 --> 25:14.350
I wouldn't be able to
run my business properly.

25:14.590 --> 25:16.390
I know you're just a young woman,

25:17.300 --> 25:18.500
and it's not easy for you.

25:18.500 --> 25:19.830
I've already reduced the interest

25:19.830 --> 25:20.880
to the minimum.

25:24.470 --> 25:26.930
Then there's no need
to think of another way.

25:28.130 --> 25:29.990
There's 50,000 yuan in this card.

25:30.190 --> 25:30.970
It's fine.

25:34.230 --> 25:35.930
He came prepared.

25:36.730 --> 25:37.960
If I refuse to

25:37.960 --> 25:39.360
accept this money today,

25:39.510 --> 25:40.880
I guess he won't step out of

25:40.880 --> 25:41.920
my room.

25:44.680 --> 25:46.540
Just consider it as a loan from me.

25:49.670 --> 25:53.410
[Wealth and Fortune]

25:49.880 --> 25:51.480
I'll return the money to you.

25:51.810 --> 25:53.610
But maybe I can't do that so soon.

25:54.110 --> 25:54.920
Not so soon?

25:55.290 --> 25:57.490
Just take your time to return the money.

25:57.790 --> 25:58.390
It's okay.

26:00.400 --> 26:01.310
Huang Xuefen.

26:04.000 --> 26:07.200
This is your grandma's
property ownership certificate.

26:07.240 --> 26:09.170
Here is the receipt from that time.

26:14.440 --> 26:16.770
Congratulations on paying off your debt.

26:17.120 --> 26:18.120
You can leave now.

26:29.610 --> 26:30.460
Let's go.

26:41.750 --> 26:43.280
I'll write you an IOU later.

26:44.610 --> 26:45.970
Pay me back in installments
over the next 50 years.

26:45.970 --> 26:47.430
Pay me once every 10 years.

26:47.850 --> 26:50.050
It doesn't have to take such a long time.

26:55.270 --> 26:55.790
Hello?

26:56.480 --> 26:57.160
Your grandpa is in the hospital.

26:57.160 --> 26:57.960
Come here now.

26:59.860 --> 27:00.380
Okay.

27:00.680 --> 27:01.810
I'll be right there.

27:03.690 --> 27:06.090
-What's wrong?
-I'm going to the hospital.

27:07.030 --> 27:07.890
What happened?

27:08.610 --> 27:09.270
My grandpa is hospitalized.

27:09.270 --> 27:10.270
I need to go there.

27:10.510 --> 27:11.440
I'll go with you.

27:11.720 --> 27:13.050
Just have a rest at home.

27:13.670 --> 27:14.600
You sold your car

27:14.620 --> 27:16.950
and saved money
to redeem the house for me.

27:17.250 --> 27:19.510
Didn't you do all those things to help me?

27:19.580 --> 27:21.240
I feel the same way as you.

27:26.890 --> 27:27.420
Let's go.

27:28.980 --> 27:30.980
[Inpatient Building]

27:34.980 --> 27:35.840
Just stop here.

27:36.400 --> 27:37.160
I think the people inside this room

27:37.160 --> 27:39.290
are all those who you don't want to see.

27:44.110 --> 27:45.300
There is nothing serious with the patient.

27:45.300 --> 27:46.830
He just needs to rest for some time.

27:46.830 --> 27:47.400
Okay.

27:47.570 --> 27:48.370
Thank you.

27:49.710 --> 27:50.910
Xixiao, you're here.

27:51.430 --> 27:54.970
[Ward No. 8]

27:56.760 --> 27:57.640
Grandpa.

27:58.000 --> 27:58.640
[Ward No. 8]

27:58.550 --> 28:00.280
My eldest grandson is here.

28:00.770 --> 28:02.570
Come on. Just sit down. Sit down.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.640
My dear eldest grandson.

28:04.900 --> 28:06.550
Well, if I had been fine,

28:06.750 --> 28:08.550
you wouldn't come see me, right?

28:08.750 --> 28:09.310
Now that I'm looking at you,

28:09.310 --> 28:10.030
you're perfectly fine,

28:10.030 --> 28:10.690
aren't you?

28:11.010 --> 28:13.420
Brat, you're just like
when you were a kid,

28:13.720 --> 28:16.180
using your sweet talk
to butter me up, right?

28:16.240 --> 28:16.790
Dad.

28:17.110 --> 28:18.350
Even if you're bickering with Xixiao,

28:18.350 --> 28:19.850
you shouldn't scare us like this.

28:19.850 --> 28:20.750
You'll still

28:20.750 --> 28:22.750
remain healthy for many more years.

28:23.060 --> 28:23.820
Yeah.

28:24.110 --> 28:26.310
You are the strong pillar of our family.

28:26.310 --> 28:27.680
You're quite blessed with good luck.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.480
The doctor has said

28:28.480 --> 28:29.550
that there's nothing serious with you.

28:29.550 --> 28:30.750
You're just too tired.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.830
After receiving IV nutrition
for a few days,

28:31.830 --> 28:33.090
you can be discharged.

28:38.590 --> 28:39.670
In my opinion,

28:39.770 --> 28:41.430
they don't mean what they say.

28:41.550 --> 28:42.610
Don't you think so?

28:42.850 --> 28:43.980
They just can't wait

28:44.070 --> 28:45.550
for my final day to come.

28:46.680 --> 28:47.280
Zhongyue.

28:48.340 --> 28:50.140
Dad, what are you talking about?

28:50.350 --> 28:51.480
We're all here because we're

28:51.480 --> 28:52.550
worried about your health.

28:52.550 --> 28:54.000
That's why we've all
gathered at the hospital

28:54.000 --> 28:55.620
to visit you.

28:55.830 --> 28:56.830
It's fine if you don't commend us

28:56.830 --> 28:58.200
for being filial.

28:58.200 --> 28:59.310
But how could you say that we have

28:59.310 --> 29:00.960
ulterior motives towards you?

29:00.960 --> 29:03.140
Dad, I am your own son.

29:03.310 --> 29:03.960
Yeah.

29:04.590 --> 29:06.590
Don't always think about
your own interests.

29:06.590 --> 29:07.570
Only by considering the big picture

29:07.570 --> 29:08.680
can you improve.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.590
Our Lanyue Group

29:13.400 --> 29:14.790
has been founded by me

29:15.030 --> 29:16.690
through my lifelong efforts.

29:17.240 --> 29:19.720
Although I've long wanted to retire,

29:19.740 --> 29:21.480
my heart and hands

29:21.640 --> 29:22.640
just won't let go.

29:23.240 --> 29:24.640
Now that I've fallen ill this time,

29:24.640 --> 29:26.090
although it's nothing serious,

29:26.090 --> 29:27.810
I know very well

29:27.840 --> 29:29.040
what my condition is.

29:29.610 --> 29:31.070
You're all clear about it, too.

29:31.070 --> 29:32.050
-Right?
-We're clear about it.

29:32.050 --> 29:33.430
So now I

29:33.550 --> 29:34.810
understand one thing.

29:34.920 --> 29:36.400
Life is more important.

29:36.420 --> 29:37.030
Yes, yes.

29:37.160 --> 29:38.640
As for the company,

29:39.080 --> 29:39.860
I think

29:40.330 --> 29:41.370
from now on,

29:42.640 --> 29:43.570
I will gradually

29:44.510 --> 29:45.840
hand it over to you guys.

29:45.890 --> 29:46.370
Dad.

29:48.090 --> 29:48.610
Dad.

29:48.630 --> 29:49.640
Just rest assured

29:49.640 --> 29:50.880
and entrust the company to me.

29:50.880 --> 29:53.550
I'll definitely
take good care of it for you.

29:53.700 --> 29:54.830
When you get better,

29:54.880 --> 29:56.210
you can come out safely.

29:56.270 --> 29:56.790
Okay?

29:56.790 --> 29:57.790
Don't worry.

29:58.720 --> 30:00.110
If it weren't for all the trouble
in your family,

30:00.110 --> 30:01.680
would Dad be so worried?

30:01.700 --> 30:03.680
-How could you...
-How could you say something like that?

30:03.680 --> 30:04.960
What do you mean by our family?

30:04.960 --> 30:06.560
What happened to our family?

30:09.920 --> 30:12.320
You haven't
married into the Lu family yet.

30:12.720 --> 30:14.030
Dad, aren't we going to

30:14.030 --> 30:15.560
have the wedding tomorrow?

30:16.240 --> 30:17.080
-Yeah, Dad.
-Come on.

30:17.080 --> 30:18.160
Peel that fruit for Dad

30:18.160 --> 30:18.960
so that he can eat it.

30:18.960 --> 30:19.400
Okay.

30:22.200 --> 30:22.790
Xixiao.

30:23.880 --> 30:25.440
What are you thinking about

30:25.680 --> 30:27.210
while sitting there alone?

30:27.270 --> 30:29.200
I'm hoping you can get better soon.

30:31.590 --> 30:33.990
My eldest grandson
cares about me the most.

30:42.480 --> 30:44.440
What are your plans for the future?

30:48.590 --> 30:49.850
You don't know, do you?

30:51.110 --> 30:53.480
Back then, I didn't know, either.

30:55.750 --> 30:56.680
Your dad was gone

30:57.350 --> 30:58.510
and left me behind.

30:59.640 --> 31:00.880
I had no choice but to

31:01.550 --> 31:03.480
struggle alone to survive.

31:05.310 --> 31:06.920
It was really so hard.

31:08.790 --> 31:10.390
If you need anything,

31:10.640 --> 31:11.350
-I can...
-I don't need you

31:11.350 --> 31:12.610
to worry about my life.

31:15.440 --> 31:17.240
Who do you want to worry about it?

31:18.030 --> 31:18.790
Lu Xixiao?

31:24.440 --> 31:25.110
Look.

31:25.960 --> 31:27.680
Look inside at this family.

31:29.050 --> 31:30.630
The old man is sick.

31:31.200 --> 31:33.800
But the people of the Lu family
are quite happy.

31:35.510 --> 31:36.710
Lu Xixiao will be sad.

31:38.550 --> 31:39.270
Him?

31:40.510 --> 31:41.510
Will he be sad?

31:42.950 --> 31:44.340
He was born lucky.

31:45.110 --> 31:47.370
He doesn't have to work hard all his life,

31:48.640 --> 31:49.640
unlike us,

31:50.880 --> 31:52.410
who are just two outsiders.

31:54.750 --> 31:56.780
When they have things to discuss,

31:56.930 --> 31:58.780
we can only stand outside.

32:01.270 --> 32:02.730
Isn't this what you chose?

32:07.000 --> 32:07.550
Yes.

32:10.110 --> 32:11.400
I chose it myself.

32:14.160 --> 32:15.620
Do you think I'm not tired?

32:20.750 --> 32:24.370
But I'm really terrified of being poor.

32:27.680 --> 32:29.210
I'd rather be a subservient

32:29.590 --> 32:30.510
pushover.

32:32.180 --> 32:33.160
Yet I still want to do my best

32:33.160 --> 32:35.090
to become a member of the Lu family.

32:43.030 --> 32:43.750
Wan.

32:45.680 --> 32:47.240
But you are different.

32:49.450 --> 32:50.630
You are still young

32:51.760 --> 32:52.440
and smart.

32:53.790 --> 32:55.450
Now that your grandma is gone,

32:56.510 --> 32:59.170
you don't have to
be afraid of anything anymore.

33:00.530 --> 33:02.140
You can choose again.

33:03.420 --> 33:05.480
The Lu family is not suitable for you.

33:05.800 --> 33:07.960
Lu Xixiao is the last person in the world

33:07.960 --> 33:09.480
you should choose.

33:17.220 --> 33:18.280
Do you know me well?

33:20.670 --> 33:22.530
Do you know where I went to school?

33:23.380 --> 33:25.040
Do you know who my friends are?

33:26.770 --> 33:27.960
Do you know how much time

33:27.960 --> 33:29.240
it took me to accept

33:29.240 --> 33:31.440
the fact that you would never come back?

33:34.720 --> 33:37.120
You don't even
know your own daughter well.

33:39.300 --> 33:40.070
What makes you think

33:40.070 --> 33:41.730
you would know Lu Xixiao well?

33:43.460 --> 33:45.720
He's not like the others of the Lu family.

33:47.070 --> 33:49.130
He would be sad because of the illness

33:50.350 --> 33:51.610
and pain of his family.

33:52.480 --> 33:53.940
He also has the ability to love others,

33:53.940 --> 33:55.670
instead of using love as a tool.

34:01.920 --> 34:03.000
Your moral coercion of him makes you look

34:03.000 --> 34:05.260
exactly like the people of the Lu family.

34:11.159 --> 34:12.989
Your stubbornness

34:13.429 --> 34:14.960
is just like your father's.

34:24.510 --> 34:25.550
You were certainly quick

34:25.550 --> 34:27.290
to come back and be a dutiful son.

34:27.290 --> 34:29.230
Someone has to take charge.

34:29.920 --> 34:31.130
Don't celebrate too early.

34:31.130 --> 34:32.190
Though Dad is delegating
his power this time,

34:32.190 --> 34:34.389
it doesn't mean I will definitely lose.

34:35.590 --> 34:36.550
Do you know right now

34:36.550 --> 34:37.550
what the gap is

34:37.550 --> 34:38.800
between the shares you have

34:38.800 --> 34:39.860
and the ones I have?

34:40.570 --> 34:41.440
How can you be so sure

34:41.440 --> 34:42.630
that Xixiao's 10% shares

34:42.630 --> 34:43.630
will be yours?

34:44.590 --> 34:46.590
Xixiao is my own son.

34:46.590 --> 34:47.590
Your schemes

34:47.699 --> 34:49.409
won't work on him.

35:13.650 --> 35:17.170
[Inpatient Building]

35:46.110 --> 35:46.630
Cheers.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.230
Cheers.

36:04.320 --> 36:05.320
Is he okay?

36:06.710 --> 36:07.310
He's fine.

36:08.900 --> 36:10.300
The test results are out,

36:10.410 --> 36:11.410
and they're good.

36:11.440 --> 36:12.790
He's probably just a bit tired.

36:12.790 --> 36:14.590
His blood pressure is a bit high.

36:15.310 --> 36:17.440
He's not going to the wedding, either.

36:18.130 --> 36:19.530
He thinks it's too noisy.

36:21.840 --> 36:22.880
So from now on,

36:23.770 --> 36:25.160
I'm going to stay here.

36:26.920 --> 36:27.860
Maybe when I have time,

36:27.860 --> 36:29.090
I'll come here more often
to keep him company

36:29.090 --> 36:30.220
and take care of him.

36:36.510 --> 36:37.320
I also didn't expect

36:37.320 --> 36:38.980
she would get what she wanted.

36:43.230 --> 36:44.440
Actually, Lu Zhongyue also needs

36:44.440 --> 36:45.770
this wedding very much.

36:47.720 --> 36:50.180
It happens that my grandpa
has given in, too.

36:50.610 --> 36:51.700
My dad

36:53.280 --> 36:56.140
never does anything
that would make him lose money.

36:59.030 --> 37:01.030
All those social events he attends,

37:01.640 --> 37:03.300
including birthday parties,

37:03.710 --> 37:04.510
wine parties

37:04.990 --> 37:05.790
and weddings,

37:06.440 --> 37:08.630
are based on the premise

37:08.630 --> 37:10.030
of exchanging benefits.

37:11.290 --> 37:13.370
It's the same for this time.

37:15.150 --> 37:17.210
The focus of his invitation isn't me,

37:19.320 --> 37:20.110
but the 10% shares

37:20.110 --> 37:21.320
I have.

37:22.560 --> 37:23.760
Because as long as I go

37:24.670 --> 37:25.860
and show up there,

37:26.100 --> 37:27.260
at the sight of me,

37:27.290 --> 37:28.290
people will know,

37:29.210 --> 37:30.670
"They're still a family."

37:31.280 --> 37:32.250
What's mine

37:32.400 --> 37:33.660
will still be his.

37:45.110 --> 37:47.310
Hearing that they're getting married,

37:48.070 --> 37:49.070
aren't you angry?

37:53.370 --> 37:54.970
In the past, I would be angry.

37:55.330 --> 37:56.660
So you're not angry now?

38:00.590 --> 38:02.990
Now there are things
that I care about more.

38:03.770 --> 38:04.630
What about you?

38:08.240 --> 38:09.240
What do you think?

38:18.300 --> 38:19.400
If this had happened in the past,

38:19.400 --> 38:21.200
I would probably be quite angry.

38:22.320 --> 38:25.360
After all, she abandoned me once.

38:27.480 --> 38:28.400
Seeing her happy

38:28.400 --> 38:29.800
feels like a...

38:31.390 --> 38:32.200
curse.

38:35.620 --> 38:37.050
But I'm quite calm now.

38:42.450 --> 38:43.260
Lu Xixiao.

38:44.290 --> 38:45.440
Let's forget what happened

38:45.440 --> 38:46.110
in the past.

38:46.690 --> 38:47.640
Let's forget

38:48.550 --> 38:49.480
both Lu Zhongyue

38:50.230 --> 38:51.290
and Guo Xiangling.

38:53.390 --> 38:54.000
Let's live

38:54.000 --> 38:55.060
our own lives well.

39:07.030 --> 39:08.490
Now that you've said this,

39:09.810 --> 39:11.560
you can't go back on your word.

39:16.700 --> 39:18.510
Then I'll stay with you a bit longer.

39:18.510 --> 39:19.510
Aren't you tired?

39:26.410 --> 39:27.870
Go home after eating this.

39:30.550 --> 39:31.950
Call me when you get home.

39:36.320 --> 39:37.700
It hurts!

39:37.780 --> 39:39.910
Why would I flick you if it didn't hurt?

39:42.260 --> 39:43.460
I'm just not leaving.

39:48.630 --> 39:50.960
What are you going to do
if you don't leave?

39:51.490 --> 39:52.850
I'm going to stay with you.

39:52.850 --> 39:54.200
Eat this first.

39:55.240 --> 39:56.330
Today, it has been

39:57.960 --> 39:59.360
such a tiring day for you.

40:01.250 --> 40:02.110
I'm exhausted.

40:14.840 --> 40:15.400
Thank you for helping me

40:15.400 --> 40:16.800
clean up the house today.

40:18.250 --> 40:19.110
Luo He won't come here

40:19.110 --> 40:20.770
to make trouble again, right?

40:22.590 --> 40:23.510
I guess so.

40:25.890 --> 40:27.750
So many things have been smashed.

40:28.110 --> 40:29.230
As for those things
that need to be replaced,

40:29.230 --> 40:30.880
you can only buy the new ones tomorrow.

40:30.880 --> 40:31.900
Then tomorrow, I'll go with you to...

40:31.900 --> 40:33.760
I can go buy them myself tomorrow.

40:41.840 --> 40:43.150
If you feel lonely

40:43.150 --> 40:44.280
eating alone,

40:44.320 --> 40:45.580
you can come to my home.

40:45.650 --> 40:46.850
My mom is fine with it.

40:49.970 --> 40:51.700
Say thank you to your mom for me.

40:51.970 --> 40:53.180
I'm not going.

40:57.850 --> 40:59.600
Last time, at your home...

41:08.020 --> 41:08.930
Have you...

41:09.000 --> 41:10.600
found out about everything?

41:20.090 --> 41:21.220
I'm sorry, Zhou Wan.

41:22.060 --> 41:23.720
I should have told you earlier

41:24.600 --> 41:26.730
about my relationship with Lu Xixiao.

41:27.970 --> 41:28.970
It's alright.

41:30.710 --> 41:31.710
You've never pressed me into telling you

41:31.710 --> 41:33.600
my relationship with my mom, either.

41:33.600 --> 41:34.400
It's the same.

41:36.790 --> 41:38.140
I just want to say

41:38.880 --> 41:40.570
during this period of time,

41:41.130 --> 41:43.390
maybe I'll go to the hospital more often.

41:45.690 --> 41:47.060
Are you injured?

41:49.000 --> 41:50.110
I'm fine.

41:50.360 --> 41:52.490
Lu Xixiao's grandpa is hospitalized.

41:59.310 --> 41:59.980
I'm sorry.

42:01.880 --> 42:04.210
I shouldn't have mentioned these things.

42:06.310 --> 42:06.940
It's fine.

42:09.630 --> 42:10.510
My feelings

42:10.510 --> 42:12.440
for the Lu family are not that deep.

42:14.110 --> 42:15.800
Asking him
to fulfill his duties as a father

42:15.800 --> 42:17.070
before I came of age

42:18.230 --> 42:19.490
was just to prevent him

42:20.160 --> 42:21.450
from feeling guilty

42:21.480 --> 42:22.480
towards me.

42:25.830 --> 42:26.590
Only by doing that

42:26.590 --> 42:27.960
will I be able to decently

42:27.960 --> 42:29.000
prove to them

42:30.290 --> 42:31.590
that I can achieve everything

42:31.590 --> 42:32.710
I want to do.

42:34.440 --> 42:37.100
I can even do it
without relying on the Lu family.

42:42.770 --> 42:44.570
I'm sorry. I've talked too much.

42:44.960 --> 42:46.160
I'm going back first.

42:50.170 --> 42:51.390
I think you can.

42:55.000 --> 42:56.240
You definitely can.

43:04.170 --> 43:04.730
Zhou Wan.

43:06.690 --> 43:07.710
I know Lu Xixiao

43:07.710 --> 43:08.670
helped you a lot.

43:10.420 --> 43:11.360
Naturally, you're supposed to

43:11.360 --> 43:12.150
help him now.

43:14.270 --> 43:15.670
But as long as you need me,

43:16.520 --> 43:17.650
I'll always be here.

43:26.070 --> 43:26.710
Good night.
